WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:21.811
While Mole shivered in the Wild Wood, Rat dozed.

2
00:00:21.812 --> 00:00:25.943
Suddenly the fire crackled loudly.

3
00:00:25.944 --> 00:00:28.485
Rat woke with a start.

4
00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:32.199
The house was quiet.

5
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.907
"Mole! Moly!" Rat shouted.

6
00:00:35.908 --> 00:00:37.844
He got up.

7
00:00:37.845 --> 00:00:40.818
"Mole's hat is gone," he said.

8
00:00:40.819 --> 00:00:43.812
"Mole's boots are not by the door.

9
00:00:43.813 --> 00:00:49.551
I bet he's gone to the Wild Wood," Rat said.

10
00:00:49.552 --> 00:00:52.348
Rat put on his coat.

11
00:00:52.349 --> 00:00:56.876
He grabbed the biggest club from his closet.

12
00:00:56.877 --> 00:01:01.489
"I hope Mole is safe," Rat said to himself.

13
00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:05.409
Rat set out for the Wild Wood.

14
00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:11.136
Inside the gloomy forest, wicked faces appeared.

15
00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:17.015
But they disappeared when they saw Rat's club.

16
00:01:17.016 --> 00:01:23.876
"Moly, Moly, Moly! Where are you!

17
00:01:23.877 --> 00:01:28.615
It's me. It's old Rat!" Rat called out.

18
00:01:28.616 --> 00:01:33.014
Rat searched every trail in the woods.

19
00:01:33.015 --> 00:01:37.028
"Mole must have left the path," he said.

20
00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:40.421
"Well, that means I will too."

21
00:01:40.422 --> 00:01:45.584
Rat stepped off the path.

22
00:01:45.585 --> 00:01:48.492
Rat looked behind rocks.

23
00:01:48.493 --> 00:01:51.882
He looked under piles of leaves.

24
00:01:51.883 --> 00:01:57.311
Then he heard a faint, scared voice.

25
00:01:57.312 --> 00:02:00.762
"Ratty?" the voice said.

26
00:02:00.763 --> 00:02:03.821
"Is that really you?"

27
00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:09.556
Rat turned. Ahead was a hollow tree.

28
00:02:09.557 --> 00:02:14.213
Rat went carefully to the tree and crept inside.

29
00:02:14.214 --> 00:02:20.994
There was poor Mole, shaking with fear.
